      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Ryan and the team were absolutely exceptional in everything: the approach, planning, installing and dealing with unexpected difficulties. I was doing a second story extension with existing solar, so that task was: carefully disconnect panels and the inverter, reconnect on the new roof, add a new solar panel with microinverters, connect with Tesla batteries (two phases) and do electrical wiring inside the house on top of that. If not for Ryan I would definitely fail: the new roof is light plastic shingles, the roof tiler simply lied to me that they are absolutely the same as normal tiles. But Ryan challenged that, contacted the manufacture, understood that every tile is screwed to the roof and can’t be shifted after the install. Then Ryan worked simultaneously with the tiler during the install – the only way to make solar work neatly with this type of tiles. Tesla batteries install was flawless, all connections not just neat and tidy – meticulous. The Solar Inspector was impressed with the quality of work. I can absolutely recommend Ryan and the team for superior quality in every detail.",
